n is part of a hypercalcemic syndrome, which could be PTHrP-mediated malignancy or parathyroid adenoma\n  recent weight loss and persistent cough → malignancy-induced hypercalcemia (PTHrP) → Malignancy-associated Hypercalcemia (PTHrP/osteolytic)"}
